        1594,
        1453,
        1746
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 2. Duties. In furtherance of the powers and duties set forth in City Charter section 20-d, ONL will serve as a central point of contact among City agencies, the nightlife industry, and New York City residents, promoting a safe and vibrant nightlife scene beneficial to businesses and residents across the five boroughs.",
      "logprob_stats": {
